-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A note on the glyphs themselves
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The glyph shapes were hand-traced from Outer Wilds, which is the property of
Mobius Digital. This project is an unaffiliated fan work. Nothing here is
endorsed by, or connected with, Mobius Digital or Annapurna Interactive.
